{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_4897f815bb90c844c68b4e1e38184a56a3c1109b24a4677708c5d674c6d8e6c6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The refactor design gives Team Leaders heartbeat-based worker lifecycle management (wake/sleep, idle timeout) with controller-enforced permission isolation: leaders may only manage workers of their own team, and workers cannot manage other workers."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b8704347047e463dd3187992c90c92b5d3cdbc3f7b393bab11d5c84481f5a1a3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The design targets two deployment modes: K8s incluster via Helm, and backward-compatible embedded mode where the controller manages worker containers through the Docker socket and runs an embedded kube-apiserver plus kine (SQLite) as a K8s API compatibility layer."}],"claim_ids":["clm_4897f815bb90c844c68b4e1e38184a56a3c1109b24a4677708c5d674c6d8e6c6","clm_b8704347047e463dd3187992c90c92b5d3cdbc3f7b393bab11d5c84481f5a1a3"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374","id":"pg_f34a809bd2995651a9871c46d718eb86","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/agentscope-ai-agentteams-docs-design-internal-agentteams-controller-re-1c46d718eb86.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_16b0962d5925536dae9f69f37e20b85e"],"title":"agentscope-ai/AgentTeams/docs/design/internal/agentteams-controller-refactor.md @ f65d6e1af268","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:31:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_4177d16b0e0a475183e3ea0c525e6374"}
